Every `--json` document, and the `--ready-file` file, uses camelCase keys.

450:- `wdaPort` → `port` (.grantiva/session.json)
451:- `bundleId` → `applicationId` (.grantiva/session.json on Android)
501:- `screen_name` → `screenName` (diff capture, diff compare)
502:- `size_bytes` → `sizeBytes` (diff capture)
503:- `point_dimensions` → `pointDimensions` (diff capture, simulator ensure)
504:- `pixel_dimensions` → `pixelDimensions` (diff capture, simulator ensure)
505:- `display_scale` → `displayScale` (diff capture, simulator ensure)
506:- `device_type` → `deviceType` (simulator ensure)
507:- `pixel_diff_percent` → `pixelDiffPercent` (diff compare)
508:- `perceptual_distance` → `perceptualDistance` (diff compare)
509:- `pixel_threshold` → `pixelThreshold` (diff compare)
510:- `perceptual_threshold` → `perceptualThreshold` (diff compare)
511:- `baseline_path` → `baselinePath` (diff compare)
512:- `capture_path` → `capturePath` (diff compare)
513:- `diff_image_path` → `diffImagePath` (diff compare)
514:- `approved_screens` → `approvedScreens` (diff approve)
515:- `baseline_directory` → `baselineDirectory` (diff approve)
516:- `bundle_id` → `bundleId` (runner start, runner stop; `applicationId` on Android)
